## ⏳ Remaining Gaps (9/27)

### Infrastructure Limitations (Cannot Complete in Single Session)
- **#12: Multi-User Authentication** - Requires user database, login system
- **#13: Real-Time Monitoring** - Requires API integrations (SolarEdge, Enphase)
- **#27: Cloud Export** - Requires S3/Drive API keys

### Physics Enhancements (Require Extensive Development)
- **#5: Tracker Modeling** - Single/dual-axis tracking simulation (4-6 hours)
- **#6: Sub-Hourly Simulation** - 15-min resolution (6-8 hours)
- **#8: Snow Loss** - Snow coverage model (2-3 hours)
- **#11: String-Level Mismatch** - IV curve modeling (4-6 hours)
- **#23: Bifacial View Factor** - Advanced rear irradiance (3-4 hours)
- **#24: IAM Curves** - PAN file extraction (2-3 hours)

### Other
- **#18: Mobile Responsiveness** - CSS/layout optimization
- **#22: PVSyst Validation** - Regression test suite
- **#26: Project History** - Database versioning

